---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Layout title="About" description={`The story behind ${SITE.name}.`}>
  <h1>About us</h1>
  <p class="lead">We started {SITE.name} because we believed most websites were slower and more complicated than they needed to be.</p>

  <div class="story">
    <p>What began as a side project building sites for friends' businesses grew into a small studio. Our approach hasn't changed: listen first, keep things simple, and ship work that is fast, accessible and easy to maintain.</p>
    <p>Today we work with startups, local businesses and established teams. Every project gets the same care, whether it's a one-page launch site or a full rebuild.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What we value</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Simplicity</h3>
      <p>Only what's needed. Less code means fewer bugs and faster pages.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Honesty</h3>
      <p>Clear timelines, clear pricing and straight answers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Craft</h3>
      <p>Details matter, from typography to page speed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .story { max-width: 40rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
</style>
